  "user": "I'm CUS-0004. Transaction TX-0401, 240.00 EUR: the goods never arrived. Which reason code applies?",
  "answer": "Reason code **goods_not_received** applies to TX-0401.\n\n- **Transaction:** EUR 240.00 card payment to TechMart Online on 2026-07-20, status settled.\n- **Window:** 90 days from the transaction date, so the dispute must be opened by 2026-10-18.\n\nThe code must match what happened, and a dispute filed under the wrong code is declined and would have to be refiled.\n\nYour account also shows a second EUR 240.00 payment to TechMart Online on 2026-07-14 (TX-0402). If that was a separate charge for the same order, duplicate_charge may be the better fit for that one.\n\nWould you like me to check eligibility for TX-0401 under goods_not_received and, if it is eligible, open the dispute?",
