                "doc": "reason-codes.md",
                "score": 1.2005,
                "text": "Reason code guide\n## Choosing a code\nThe reason code must match what actually happened. A dispute filed under the\nwrong code is declined and must be refiled, which may push it past its window."
              },
              {
                "id": "disputes-process.md#s6",
                "doc": "disputes-process.md",
                "score": 0.8839,
                "text": "Dispute handling process\n## Withdrawing a dispute\nA customer may withdraw a dispute at any time before resolution. Withdrawal is\nfinal; the same transaction cannot be disputed again under the same reason code."
